msgstr "SERIAL3 -> USART1（GPS1），TX/RX 支持 DMA"

#: ../../source/docs/common-radiolinkpix6.rst:506
#: df7b2423f9704a72acc8ca108a37b760
msgid "SERIAL4 -> UART4 (GPS2), No DMA"
msgstr "SERIAL4 -> UART4（GPS2），不支持 DMA"

#: ../../source/docs/common-radiolinkpix6.rst:507
#: 2b5fd69958804b32aec57ee7193e0f2a
msgid "SERIAL5 -> UART7 (User), No DMA"
msgstr "SERIAL5 -> UART7（用户），不支持 DMA"

#: ../../source/docs/common-radiolinkpix6.rst:510
#: db074b07624f439c948da5dca76616b5
msgid "RC Input"
msgstr "RC 输入"

#: ../../source/docs/common-radiolinkpix6.rst:511
#: d4c3decdb3174d05af5641d7c92939e9
msgid ""
"The RCIN pin, which by default is mapped to a timer input, can be used for "
"all ArduPilot supported receiver protocols, except CRSF/ELRS and SRXL2 which"
" require a true UART connection. However, FPort, when connected in this "
"manner, will only provide RC without telemetry."
msgstr ""
"RCIN 引脚默认映射到定时器输入，可用于所有 ArduPilot 支持的接收机协议，但 CRSF/ELRS 和 SRXL2 除外（这些协议需要真正的 "
"UART 连接）。但是，以这种方式连接时，FPort 只能提供 RC 信号而无数传功能。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-radiolinkpix6.rst:513
#: 0f82afa227bc4cd9aa05477912b452e4
msgid ""
"To allow CRSF and embedded telemetry available in Fport, CRSF, and SRXL2 "
"receivers, a full UART with DMA capability, such as SERIAL1 (USART2) would "
"need to be used for receiver connections. Below are setups using Serial6."
msgstr ""
"要支持 FPort、CRSF 和 SRXL2 接收机中的 CRSF 和嵌入式数传，需要使用具有 DMA 能力的完整 UART（如 "
"SERIAL1（USART2））进行接收机连接。以下是使用 Serial6 的配置示例。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-radiolinkpix6.rst:516
#: 331165e679b44b6884da819daa9ebf21
msgid ":ref:`SERIAL1_PROTOCOL <SERIAL1_PROTOCOL>` should be set to “23”."
msgstr ":ref:`SERIAL1_PROTOCOL <SERIAL1_PROTOCOL>` 应设置为「23」。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-radiolinkpix6.rst:517
#: 4f59e90434f34a669e503a123c7fc775
msgid ""
"FPort would require :ref:`SERIAL1_OPTIONS <SERIAL1_OPTIONS>` be set to “15”."
msgstr "FPort 需要将 :ref:`SERIAL1_OPTIONS <SERIAL1_OPTIONS>` 设置为「15」。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-radiolinkpix6.rst:518
#: b9a41db33b70477e9dc78fa9755cac77
msgid ""
"CRSF would require :ref:`SERIAL1_OPTIONS <SERIAL1_OPTIONS>` be set to “0”."
msgstr "CRSF 需要将 :ref:`SERIAL1_OPTIONS <SERIAL1_OPTIONS>` 设置为「0」。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-radiolinkpix6.rst:519
#: 69476bd8d8f943178a7c07822bb2ecb5
msgid ""
"SRXL2 would require :ref:`SERIAL1_OPTIONS <SERIAL1_OPTIONS>` be set to “4” "
"and connects only the TX pin."
msgstr ""
"SRXL2 需要将 :ref:`SERIAL1_OPTIONS <SERIAL1_OPTIONS>` 设置为「4」，并且只连接 TX 引脚。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-radiolinkpix6.rst:521
#: ffb0ec178bf547afaea4efcb08e7b702
msgid ""
"Any UART can be used for RC system connections in ArduPilot also, and is "
"compatible with all protocols except PPM. See :ref:`common-rc-systems` for "
"details."
msgstr ""
"在 ArduPilot 中，任何 UART 均可用于 RC 系统连接，并兼容除 PPM 以外的所有协议。详情请参见 :ref:`common-rc-"
"systems`。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-radiolinkpix6.rst:524
#: 8b3b72c8c1dd4afb80fb562e761d2e0f
msgid "OSD Support"
msgstr "OSD 支持"

#: ../../source/docs/common-radiolinkpix6.rst:526
#: ff5f04ac04a34711892c74840864458c
msgid ""
"The RadiolinkPIX6 support using its internal OSD using OSD_TYPE 1 (MAX7456 "
"driver). External OSD support such as DJI or DisplayPort is supported using "
"UART3 or any other free UART. See :ref:`common-msp-osd-overview-4.2` for "
"more info."
msgstr ""
"RadiolinkPIX6 支持通过 OSD_TYPE 1（MAX7456 驱动）使用其内部 OSD。外部 OSD 支持（如 DJI 或 "
"DisplayPort）可通过 UART3 或任何其他空闲 UART 实现。详情请参见 :ref:`common-msp-osd-"
"overview-4.2`。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-radiolinkpix6.rst:529
#: a8707a05dd4a4e9b94db21d4577811dd
msgid "PWM Outputs"
msgstr "PWM 输出"

#: ../../source/docs/common-radiolinkpix6.rst:531
#: f877d5d2cdf34162b994a303c419b994
msgid ""
"The RadiolinkPIX6 supports up to 16 PWM outputs. All 16 outputs support all "
"normal PWM output formats. All FMU (\"AUX OUT\") outputs also support DShot."
msgstr ""
"RadiolinkPIX6 支持最多 16 路 PWM 输出。所有 16 路输出均支持所有普通 PWM 输出格式。所有 FMU（「AUX "
"OUT」）输出也支持 DShot。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-radiolinkpix6.rst:533
#: 5ab80f224eb546da9fd49e15971744da
msgid "The 8 FMU PWM outputs are in 4 groups:"
msgstr "8 路 FMU PWM 输出分为 4 组："

#: ../../source/docs/common-radiolinkpix6.rst:536
#: 37af44886edb4d43b1d8f30a8a4e6290
msgid "Outputs 1, 2, 3 and 4 in group1"
msgstr "输出 1、2、3 和 4 在第 1 组"

#: ../../source/docs/common-radiolinkpix6.rst:537
#: 13cf0905052b451baf955c1fe19d8936
msgid "Outputs 5 and 8 in group2"
msgstr "输出 5 和 8 在第 2 组"

#: ../../source/docs/common-radiolinkpix6.rst:538
#: dfab57b0db5b49bd9daae00a483338fd
msgid "Outputs 6 and 7 in group3"
msgstr "输出 6 和 7 在第 3 组"

#: ../../source/docs/common-radiolinkpix6.rst:540
#: 7398103c8b764ac4bcfd87649fdbc347
msgid ""
"FMU outputs within the same group need to use the same output rate and "
"protocol, ie. if any output in a group uses DShot then all channels in that "
"group need to use DShot."
msgstr "同一组内的 FMU 输出需要使用相同的输出速率和协议，即如果某组中任何输出使用 DShot，则该组中所有通道都需要使用 DShot。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-radiolinkpix6.rst:543
#: 19bdbb2aec7e4a048b2854291e135849
msgid "Battery Monitoring"
msgstr "电池监控"

#: ../../source/docs/common-radiolinkpix6.rst:545
#: aa69e5eb1a254d3c98f0872eb842f5a7
msgid ""
"The board has 2 dedicated power monitor ports with a 6 pin connector. One is"
" the Analog power monitor(Power1), and the others is the I2C power "
"monitor(Power2)."
msgstr "该板有 2 个专用电源监控接口，使用 6 针接口。一个是模拟电源监控（Power1），另一个是 I2C 电源监控（Power2）。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-radiolinkpix6.rst:548
#: 0b7cdc7974f94a2ca3b08bb8a6d651f0
msgid "Power1 port(Analog)"
msgstr "Power1 接口（模拟）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-radiolinkpix6.rst:550
#: 225696b2bcd24b65ae8f4e1542e7eec8
