"The RadiolinkPIX6 has a built-in compass. Due to potential interference, the"
" autopilot is usually used with an external I2C compass as part of a "
"GPS/Compass combination."
msgstr "RadiolinkPIX6 内置罗盘。由于潜在干扰，飞控通常配合 GPS/罗盘组合中的外部 I2C 罗盘使用。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-radiolinkpix6.rst:573
